SUMMARY:Mobile Music Legends exhibit at Moorer Branch Library
DESCRIPTION:The Monte L. Moorer/Spring Hill Branch Library hosts the first
  annual Mobile Music Legends exhibit. The display celebrates artists and 
 ensembles who carried the soul\, jazz and spirit of the Gulf Coast to the
  world. The exhibit stays up from November 1 to December 15.\nPrice: not 
 published by the venue\, so confirm before you go\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin
  County\nTimes: Library hours · 11/1 to 12/15 · closed Sundays\nChecked
